{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious cult has captured you. You're suspended from a conveyor mechanism and forced to partake in a collection of ritualistic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a tactile physics-driven weapon system with a unique manual reload feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/Gunplay_Gif.gif?t=1751009974\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate small interconnected tunnel networks by selecting markers to move towards. Discover new paths, unlock shortcuts and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/Moving_Gif.gif?t=1751009974\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect useful resources like food, ammo, keys and guns. Completionists also have secret items to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/Door_Gif.gif?t=1751009974\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleanse the tunnels of cultists and creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you conquer the tunnels and escape with your life?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644930?t=1751009974","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644930?t=1751009974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/242a3979e9e16a79b1537aaa59c6324675cb3c50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751009974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/242a3979e9e16a79b1537aaa59c6324675cb3c50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751009974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Stylized PS1-era violence with guns, melee weapons, and exaggerated blood/dismemberment\u2014all rendered in surreal, low-poly aesthetics."},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious cult has captured you. You're suspended from a conveyor mechanism and forced to partake in a collection of ritualistic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a tactile physics-driven weapon system with a unique manual reload feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/Gunplay_Gif.gif?t=1751009974\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate small interconnected tunnel networks by selecting markers to move towards. Discover new paths, unlock shortcuts and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/Moving_Gif.gif?t=1751009974\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect useful resources like food, ammo, keys and guns. Completionists also have secret items to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/Door_Gif.gif?t=1751009974\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleanse the tunnels of cultists and creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you conquer the tunnels and escape with your life?</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alex Rassloff"],"genres":[{"descriptio